OL,3,GNEWSARevised race schedule means extra
OL,4,Aroads closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads on the Isle of Man will remain
OL,7,Fclosed for most of Monday to
OL,8,Faccommodate a major overhaul of the
OL,9,FClassic TT and Manx Grand Prix race
OL,10,Fschedule.
OL,12,FThe 37.7 mile (61km) Mountain Course
OL,13,Fclosed at 09:30 BST and will remain
OL,14,Fshut until 16:30. It will then close
OL,15,Fagain from 18:00 until no later than
OL,16,F21:00.
OL,18,FThe additional evening closure comes
OL,19,Fafter organisers brought the entire
OL,20,Frace programme forward due to a
OL,21,Fforecast of rain from Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
